ntnhcore.questtext.d74960b39acf2022b53eb:
Well, you've completed the space stage of the game; now the entire space knows and fears you (you are a true space pirate). Here are a couple more nuances about the #{00aaaa}Dyson swarm#{reset}:

#{00aa00}Do not place #{00aaaa}converters#{reset} directly next to the #{00aaaa}receiver#{reset} - this will cause a malfunction.#{reset}

