ntnhcore.ntsd.credits.body:
#{ffce86}Original book and NTNH#{reset}
The quest system is adapted from Nuclear Tech: New Horizons for Minecraft 1.7.10. SkippyPlaysMC created the original book for NTI/STI and Bufka2011 revised it. Thanks to NTNH contributors, NTM Wiki authors and community members who helped the original book. Second Dawn is a separate unofficial adaptation and does not claim original authorship of that work.

#{ffce86}HBM and the technology foundation#{reset}
HBM Nuclear Tech Mod: HbmMods and contributors. NTM Continuum, Space and Golem Core: Warfactory, Golem and their project contributors. Legacy HBM and NTNHCore components retain their separate provenance and license terms.

#{ffce86}Quest platform and add-ons#{reset}
Better Questing: Funwayguy and contributors; Standard Expansion: its add-on authors. Applied Energistics 2: AlgorithmX2, the AE2 team and contributors; ExtendedAE: GlodBlock and contributors; Storage Drawers: Justin Aquadro and contributors. Thanks to every installed mod's authors; see the pack documentation for the complete factual catalog.

#{ffce86}Translations and presentation#{reset}
Translations draw on Russian Translations and Fixes, RushanM and contributors, RTF+ and other catalogued sources. The pack owner supplied the NTSD artwork and pixel icon. The revised introduction and interface were prepared for Second Dawn. Third-party texts, images, fonts and code retain their authors' rights; rebranding does not remove license obligations.

